    {
      "label": "Description",
      "value": [
        "You hurl a mote of fire at a creature or an object within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 Fire damage. A flammable object hit by this spell starts burning if it isn’t being worn or carried.",
        "Cantrip Upgrade. The damage increases by 1d10 when you reach levels 5 (2d10), 11 (3d10), and 17 (4d10)."
      ],
      "html": "<div> <p>You hurl a mote of fire at a creature or an object within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 Fire damage. A flammable object hit by this spell starts <a>burning</a> if it isn’t being worn or carried.</p> <p><strong><em>Cantrip Upgrade.</em></strong> The damage increases by 1d10 when you reach levels 5 (2d10), 11 (3d10), and 17 (4d10).</p> </div>",
